// Monday to Friday mornings at Kaminato University. Daichi drops a hint about
// Luna every day; Friday is Professor Ueda's quiz (passed with 2 study).
//
// Lines: Monday 101.., Tuesday 201.., Wednesday 301.., Thursday 401..,
// Friday 501.. (pass 511.., fail 521..). Narration pale blue, speech cream.

str col101a
    en "Monday. Kaminato University, first day. The campus is enormous."
str col102a
    en "In the lecture hall, the only free seat is next to a guy in a mustard hoodie."
str col103a
    en "Yo! New face. I'm Daichi. Daichi Mori. You lost too?"
str col104a
    en "Kai. I just moved here. Hikari Street, Sato House."
str col105a
    en "No way, Hikari Street? Then you live next to the Moonbean Cafe! Best coffee in Kaminato. And the prettiest barista, too. Luna."
str col106a
    en "L-Luna? I mean... I might have seen her. Through the window. Once."
str col107a
    en "Ha! You've got it bad already. We went to the same high school, you know. Astronomy club. She was the only one who actually showed up at night."
str col108a
    en "Mr. Mori, if you are quite finished, ASTR 101 would like to begin. A reminder for everyone: there is a quiz on Friday."
str col109a
    en "...Friday already? Ugh. Study for it, Kai. Ueda's quizzes are brutal."

str col201a
    en "Tuesday. Professor Ueda spends ninety minutes on the summer triangle."
str col202a
    en "Hey, Kai. Tip from an old astronomy club member. If Luna ever asks what you like about this city, don't say the food."
str col203a
    en "Say the stars over the harbour. She'll talk your ear off. Trust me."
str col204a
    en "The stars over the harbour. Got it. ...Why are you helping me?"
str col205a
    en "Because you look like a lost puppy, and lost puppies deserve coffee. Also, you owe me lunch now."
str col206a
    en "Friday's quiz covers chapters one to three. The library is open until nine."

str col301a
    en "Wednesday. Grey clouds roll in over the bay."
str col302a
    en "You know Luna draws, right? On her breaks. Always in the same old sketchbook."
str col303a
    en "Word of advice: never grab it. A guy tried that in high school. She didn't speak to him for a year."
str col304a
    en "Noted. Ask, don't grab."
str col305a
    en "She goes to art school at night. Wants to illustrate books, I think. Don't tell her I told you."

str col401a
    en "Thursday. Posters all over campus: STAR FESTIVAL, SATURDAY, HILL OBSERVATORY."
str col402a
    en "The Star Festival! Lanterns, food stalls, and the big telescope open all night."
str col403a
    en "Tickets are ten dollars each. Twenty for two... if you were, say, inviting someone."
str col404a
    en "Twenty dollars. Right. (...I should check my wallet.)"
str col405a
    en "Ask her soon, Kai. Saturday comes fast."

str col501a
    en "Friday. The quiz. Professor Ueda hands out the papers in silence."
str col511a
    en "Question one: name the brightest star of the summer triangle. Kai smiles and writes it down. Vega."
str col512a
    en "You passed? Traitor! I thought we were going to fail together."
str col521a
    en "Question one... Question one... Kai stares at the page until it stares back."
str col522a
    en "Don't look at me like that. I failed too. Noodles? My treat. Your treat."

